13
00:00:56,840 --> 00:01:04,080
It might remind us of family gatherings, school days, or travels long gone.

14
00:01:04,080 --> 00:01:10,240
Researchers have found that smell can instantly activate memories we thought we'd forgotten.

15
00:01:10,240 --> 00:01:17,120
For many people, a familiar perfume can bring back events and feelings from years ago.

16
00:01:17,120 --> 00:01:22,280
That's because the part of our brain that processes smell is closely linked to the region

17
00:01:22,280 --> 00:01:29,800
