18
00:01:29,800 --> 00:01:35,640
Now moving on, let's think about what tends to trigger nostalgia most often.

19
00:01:35,640 --> 00:01:40,480
The things we keep from the past can act as powerful emotional cues.

20
00:01:40,480 --> 00:01:46,920
