35
00:02:49,760 --> 00:02:55,560
Next, let's consider how nostalgia affects us emotionally.

36
00:02:55,560 --> 00:03:02,280
Nostalgia can work as a natural coping mechanism when people feel emotionally low.

37
00:03:02,280 --> 00:03:09,680
By revisiting happy experiences, individuals can temporarily relieve the weight of depression.

38
00:03:09,680 --> 00:03:16,600
It serves almost like a psychological reset reminding us that joy and meaning have existed

39
00:03:16,600 --> 00:03:18,960
