40
00:03:18,960 --> 00:03:25,160
Certain flavours are strongly tied to early experiences and family traditions.

41
00:03:25,160 --> 00:03:31,040
The smell or taste of a cake made at home can awaken joyful memories from one's younger

42
00:03:31,040 --> 00:03:32,720
