43
00:03:32,720 --> 00:03:40,320
This connection between taste and memory is often what makes traditional foods so comforting.

44
00:03:40,320 --> 00:03:45,840
They take us back to childhood kitchens and the people who cared for us.

45
00:03:45,840 --> 00:03:51,000
Sound is one of the most direct pathways to emotional recall.

46
00:03:51,000 --> 00:03:56,640
Just a single song from the past can awaken vivid memories and recreate the mood of an

47
00:03:56,640 --> 00:03:58,960
