54
00:04:30,240 --> 00:04:36,520
By showing images or playing music from the past, these campaigns encourage people to act

55
00:04:36,520 --> 00:04:40,040
out of compassion and shared values.

56
00:04:40,040 --> 00:04:47,240
Nostalgia is sometimes used as a gentle form of therapy in hospitals and care homes.

57
00:04:47,240 --> 00:04:53,040
A trained nurse might prompt patients to recall pleasant experiences as a way to reduce

58
00:04:53,040 --> 00:04:56,280
